$ maestro decision draft "sessions carry a start-time incarnation; a pid match without a matching incarnation is dead" --rationale "both lanes reject pid-only identity; A proposes an incarnation stamp, B a heartbeat row; a heartbeat needs a writer that d5 forbids" --work w1
