rationale: both lanes reject pid-only identity; A proposes an incarnation stamp, B a heartbeat row; a heartbeat needs a writer that d5 forbids
work: w1

$ maestro decision lock d1
d1 [locked] sessions carry a start-time incarnation; a pid match without a matching incarnation is dead
rationale: both lanes reject pid-only identity; A proposes an incarnation stamp, B a heartbeat row; a heartbeat needs a writer that d5 forbids
work: w1

$ maestro work note w1 "dissent from x2: a heartbeat would also detect a hung process; deferred, not rejected"
w1 note: dissent from x2: a heartbeat would also detect a hung process; deferred, not rejected
